{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30858","headline":"岐阳逢曲阳故人话旧 · 马戴","name":"岐阳逢曲阳故人话旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异地还相见，平生问可知。\n壮年俱欲暮，往事尽堪悲。\n道路频艰阻，亲朋久别离。\n解兵逃白刃，谒帝值明时。\n淹疾生涯故，因官事业移。\n鸡鸣关月落，鴈度朔风吹。\n客泪翻岐下，乡心落海湄。\n积愁何计遣，满酌浣相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}